@startuml screenflow-moderation
' Spec 004 — screen flow. Each state is a screen (key elements listed); each arrow is a user action.
' Every user story US-004-1..11 is a path through this diagram (see table in spec.md).

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor white
  BackgroundColor<<public>> #f8fafc
  BackgroundColor<<email>> #fef3c7
  BackgroundColor<<other>> #e0e7ff
  BorderColor #94a3b8
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam arrowFontSize 11

title Spec 004 — screen flow (375 px, Admin; the Employer appears where a decision reaches them)

state "Drawer (☰)" as Drawer <<public>>
Drawer : Admin: Browse · Admin · Settings · Log out

state "Admin area (spec 002)" as AdminArea <<public>>
AdminArea : Listings — "2 waiting for approval"
AdminArea : Regions
AdminArea : My listings · Post a job

state "Listings (Admin)" as Listings
Listings : Waiting for approval (2) · Published · Needs changes ·
Listings : Taken down · Closed
Listings : Cashier
Listings : Kape Isla · Cebu
Listings : ₱12,000–13,000/mo · submitted 3 h ago
Listings : Barista  (Your listing)
Listings : Lutong Bahay · Davao City
Listings : ₱14,000–16,000/mo · submitted 20 min ago
Listings : 50 rows at a time · [ Show more ]
Listings : (empty) "Nothing is waiting for approval."

state "Listing (Admin view)" as Review
Review : ← Listings (back to the list I came from)
Review : status, "Your listing" if it is mine
Review : Posted by business · account email
Review : Submitted 3 h ago
Review : latest decision: what, when, by which Admin
Review : Needs changes / Taken down: "The reason given to the employer"
Review : hidden region: "hidden" pill, and while it is
Review : waiting, why it cannot be approved
Review : one sentence on what approving / taking down does
Review : Waiting for approval: **[ Approve ]** [ Reject ] [ Edit ]
Review : Published: See the public page (005) · [ Take down ] [ Edit ]
Review : Needs changes / Taken down / Closed: no actions
Review : then the listing as visitors will see it

state "Reject" as Reject
Reject : (the Admin view, with this form in place of the actions)
Reject : "What needs to change?" ___________
Reject : "The employer will see this."
Reject : <color:#dc2626>[ Reject listing ]</color>   Cancel

state "Take down" as TakeDown
TakeDown : (the Admin view, with this form in place of the actions)
TakeDown : "Why is it being taken down?" ______
TakeDown : "The employer will see this. This cannot be undone."
TakeDown : <color:#dc2626>[ Take down ]</color>   Cancel

state "Edit listing (Admin)" as Edit
Edit : "For small fixes… The employer will be told what you changed."
Edit : same fields as the Employer's form
Edit : plus Business name and About the business (this listing only)
Edit : **[ Save changes ]**   Cancel

state "Email to the Employer" as MailEmployer <<email>>
MailEmployer : Your listing is published
MailEmployer : Your listing needs changes + the reason
MailEmployer : Your listing was taken down + the reason
MailEmployer : We edited your listing + what changed
MailEmployer : link → the listing in My listings

state "Email to Admins" as MailAdmins <<email>>
MailAdmins : A listing is waiting for approval
MailAdmins : link → the listing (Admin view)

state "Employer: Listing (owner view, spec 003)" as Owner <<other>>
Owner : Published / Needs changes + reason /
Owner : Taken down + reason

[*] --> Drawer : logged in as Admin
Drawer --> AdminArea : Admin
AdminArea --> Listings : Listings
Listings --> Listings : choose a status\nshow more
Listings --> Review : tap a row
Review --> Listings : back
Review --> Review : Approve refused (hidden region, or\ndecided by another Admin) → message,\nlisting shown as it now is
Review --> Listings : Approve → Published\n(withdrawn meanwhile → message, on the queue)
Review --> Reject : Reject
Reject --> Listings : reject with a reason → Needs changes
Reject --> Reject : reason missing or too short
Reject --> Review : cancel\n(no longer waiting → message)
Review --> TakeDown : Take down
TakeDown --> Review : take down with a reason → Taken down
TakeDown --> TakeDown : reason missing or too short
TakeDown --> Review : cancel\n(no longer published → message)
Review --> Edit : Edit\n(Waiting for approval / Published)
Edit --> Review : save changes
Edit --> Edit : validation error
Edit --> Review : cancel\n(can no longer be edited → message.\nnothing changed → 'Nothing was changed.')

Review -[dotted]-> MailEmployer : on approve, reject, take down or edit\n(not when the listing is the Admin's own)
MailEmployer --> Owner : employer follows the link\n(logs in if needed)
Owner -[dotted]-> MailAdmins : employer submits\nor resubmits (003)\n(not to an Admin who submitted it)
MailAdmins --> Review : Admin follows the link\n(logs in if needed)

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | light grey | shared navigation |
  | amber | an email, not a screen |
  | blue | a screen from spec 003, seen by the Employer |
  | dotted arrow | sent by the app, not a tap |
  | [ brackets ] | a button |
  | **[ bold ]** | the screen's accent action |
  | <color:#dc2626>[ red ]</color> | a destructive action |
endlegend
@enduml
